ontext` roundtrip.\n   - property attribute flags JS_READONLY(1)/JS_DONTENUM(2)/JS_DONTCONF(4) and all 8\n     combinations, via `js_defproperty`/`js_defglobal`/`js_defaccessor`; what each\n     forbids at runtime (in strict vs non-strict).\n   - `js_pushiterator(J, idx, own)` with own=0 and own=1.\n2. Distinct value/data SHAPES: undefined, null, true, false, number (0, -0, NaN,\n   +/-Infinity, integer, fraction, 2^31, 2^32, 2^53), string (empty, ASCII, multi-byte\n   UTF-8, embedded NUL via js_pushlstring, very long), object (empty, few props, many\n   props forcing a property-tree rebalance), array (empty, 1, many, sparse, length\n   boundary 2^32-1), function (JS function, C function via js_newcfunction, cconstructor,\n   bound arity 0/1/many), userdata (js_newuserdata / js_newuserdatax with each callback\n   set vs NULL), regexp object, Date object, Error object.\n3. Stack-index shapes for the whole index-taking API (js_copy, js_getindex, js_type,\n   js_isX, js_toX, js_remove, js_insert, js_replace, js_rot...): positive absolute index,\n   negative relative index (-1, -2, -top), index 0.\n4. Every low-level exported entry point in these files, not just the wrappers. See:\n   nm -D --defined-only /local/home/scheschb/.harvest/work/harvest-work-jqRrno/c_src/build/libmujs.so | awk '{print $3}' | sort -u\n   In particular give rows for: jsV_getproperty, jsV_getpropertyx, jsV_getownproperty,\n   jsV_setproperty, jsV_delproperty, jsV_newiterator, jsV_nextiterator, jsV_newobject,\n   jsV_newmemstring, jsV_resizearray, jsV_toboolean/tonumber/tostring/tointeger/\n   toobject/toprimitive, jsR_newenvironment, jsR_unflattenarray, jsS_dumpstrings,\n   jsS_freestrings, js_intern, jsB_propf/propn/props, each jsB_init* function,\n   js_newarguments, js_newfunction, js_newscript, js_pushvalue/js_tovalue/js_pushobject,\n   js_savetry/js_savetrypc/js_endtry, js_trap, js_putc/js_puts/js_putm,\n   js_malloc/js_realloc/js_free/js_strdup, js_ref/js_unref, js_loadeval.\n5. Builtin-li