` calls `checkfutureword` unconditionally while `ctrycatchfinally` calls it only inside `if (F->strict)` — a genuine behavioural difference between `try/catch` and `try/catch/finally` (jscompile.c:957 vs 989).\n- `memlimit` is decremented on alloc but never credited back on free (explicit `TODO` at jsrun.c:69, 90), so it is a cumulative allocation budget, not a live-heap cap. Both limits treat `<= 0` as unlimited.\n- `Dp_setUTCHours` uses `HourFromTime` (not `MinFromTime`) as the default for its `min` argument (jsdate.c:748) — asymmetric with `Dp_setHours`.\n- `js_ref` returns fixed strings (`_Undefined`, `_Null`, `_True`, `_False`) for those four values, a pointer-formatted intern for objects, and a `J->nextref` counter for other primitives."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2369,"cache_read_input_tokens":215371,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2369,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_018Gw5ooxsn2owAndP9bTbK2","session_id":"365846c7-7961-47ff-8218-f2422469d650","uuid":"5c2a00a4-62a7-40af-bc99-4a271f61b0ef","timestamp":"2026-08-31T06:52:43.931Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"CONFIGS part 3: state and runtime API"}
