o work for `.`, which sees a decoded rune).\n- `\\0`, `\\x00`, `\\u0000` and `\\c@` all compile to `I_CHAR` with `c == 0`, which **no subject can ever match** (every consuming opcode bails on `!*sp`). There are no octal escapes (`\\101` lexes as back-reference 10).\n- `[]` matches nothing; `[^]` matches any single rune including newline.\n- Captures inside `(?=...)` persist (matched against `out`), captures inside `(?!...)` are discarded (matched against `scratch`).\n- Max **15** capturing groups (group 0 takes a slot); `(?:...)` consumes none.\n- `js_Regexp.last` is `unsigned short`, so global-flag lastIndex truncates past 65535.\n\nConstructs that are *not* supported and therefore got no valid-path row (they belong in ERRORS.md): quantified anchors (`^*`), `(a*)*`/`(a*)+` (\"infinite loop matching the empty string\"), a 16th capturing group, `{255}`+ counts, forward/undefined back-references, identity escapes of letters, unterminated classes/groups."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":409,"cache_read_input_tokens":146411,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":409,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01Uk1rKJqkmq4n94NL8zq5zM","session_id":"365846c7-7961-47ff-8218-f2422469d650","uuid":"ac8e2251-9086-467b-82d7-375156022eee","timestamp":"2026-08-31T07:00:45.034Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"CONFIGS part 2: regexp"}
