)`.\n- `Math.max`/`Math.min` use `signbit` comparisons, giving the asymmetric `-0` results pinned by `1/Math.min(0,-0)` vs `1/Math.max(0,-0)`.\n- `Number.prototype.toLocaleString` is `Np_toString` registered with `n=0`, so `(255).toLocaleString(16)` still honours the radix and yields `'ff'` (verified deterministic across runs).\n\n## One leftover\n`translation/target/corpwork/` contains the temporary validation driver (`corpdrv.c`, compiled binary, `*.out` logs). I attempted to delete it but the sandbox denied the `rm`. It lives inside the Cargo `target/` build-output directory, so it should be harmless, but feel free to remove it.","usage":{"total_tokens":237076,"tool_uses":64,"duration_ms":970924},"uuid":"0db2ecea-a4d4-477b-878f-fb25c78a1494","session_id":"365846c7-7961-47ff-8218-f2422469d650"}
