atches`, `utflen_matches`, `utfptrtoidx_matches`, `runeat_matches`) |\n| 7. public stack API overflow / underflow / index | 132-153 | `tests/c09_api_errors.rs` (`row_132_*`, `rows_133_134_*`, `row_138_*`, `rows_140_141_*`, `row_142_*`, `rows_150_151_153_*`, `row_135_136_*`) |\n| 8. public coercions that throw | 154-168 | `tests/c09_api_errors.rs` (`rows_154_156_*`, `row_157_*`, `rows_158_159_*`, `rows_160_161_*`, `rows_162_164_*`, `row_165_*`) and `tests/c10_boxing_order.rs` |\n| 9. call / try / limit machinery | 169-194 | `tests/c09_api_errors.rs` (`rows_169_172_*`, `rows_174_175_*`, `rows_176_177_194_*`, `rows_180_183_*`, `row_184_*`, `row_189_*`) |\n| 10. `js_newstate` / `js_dostring` / `js_ploadstring` / try-converters | 195-214 | `tests/c09_api_errors.rs` (`rows_195_201_*`, `rows_202_211_*`, `rows_203_206_*`, `row_212_*`, `row_214_*`) and `tests/b05_stackapi.rs` (`custom_allocator_matches` for rows 196-198) |\n| 11. property access / array limits | 215-250 | `tests/c09_api_errors.rs` (`rows_215_220_*`, `rows_221_239_*`, `rows_240_241_*`, `rows_243_246_*`, `row_248_*`) and `tests/b08_numeric_torture.rs` (`array_length_boundary_matches`) |\n| 12. lexer rejections | 251-276 | `tests/corpus/errors_lexer.txt` via `tests/b06_scripts.rs` + `tests/c11_corpus_all.rs`, and `tests/c12_internals.rs` (`jsy_lex_token_streams_match`) |\n| 13. parser rejections | 277-286 | `tests/corpus/errors_parser_compiler.txt`, and `tests/c12_internals.rs` (`jsp_parse_and_jsc_compilescript_match`) |\n| 14. compiler rejections | 287-319 | `tests/corpus/errors_parser_compiler.txt`, `tests/corpus/strict_mode.txt`, `tests/c12_internals.rs` (`jsc_error_js_newfunction_and_js_trap_match`) |\n| 15. `js_newregexp` and RegExp built-ins | 320-334 | `tests/corpus/errors_builtins.txt`, `tests/b07_random.rs` (`randomized_regexp_through_js_api`), `tests/b08_numeric_torture.rs` (`regexp_lastindex_numeric_torture`) |\n| 16. remaining built-ins | 335-445 | `tests/corpus/errors_builtins.txt`, `tests/corpus/builtins_*.txt`, `tests/b07_random.rs`, `tests/b08_numeric_torture.rs` |\n\nAn extra guard test, `error_corpora_really_error_in_c` (in `tests/c11_corpus_all.rs`),\nasserts that every snippet in every `tests/corpus/errors_*.txt` file genuinely\nproduces a non-zero `js_ploadstring`/`js_pcall` return code **in the C build**, so\nno \"error\" row can silently degrade into a happy path.\n\n### Rows deliberately NOT tested (C-side undefined behaviour)\n\nThese rows document places where the C has **no check at all**, so there is no\ndefined result to compare. They are listed in `UNCHECKED_UB_ROWS` in\n`tests/c09_api_errors.rs` (asserted present by `unchecked_ub_rows_are_documented`)\nrather than silently skipped:\n\n| rows | why |\n|---|---|\n| 137 | `js_pushlstring` with negative `n`: `while (n--)` overruns the buffer |\n| 139 | `js_pop` with negative `n`: `TOP` grows with no `CHECKSTACK` |\n| 143-148 | `js_rot2/3/4`, `js_rot2pop1`, `js_rot3pop2`, `js_rot` with too few values: read/write below `BOT` |\n| 149 | `js_dup` on an empty frame: reads `STACK[TOP-1]` |\n| 152 | `js_currentfunctiondata` type confusion on a non-C-function |\n| 173 | `js_construct` with `n < 0`: negative stack index |\n| 199, 200, 216-218, 242 | `assert()`s (compiled out in the release build of either language) |\n\nTwo further conditions are reachable but end in `abort()` in BOTH\nimplementations, so they are compared **across processes** (exit status, killing\nsignal and captured stderr) rather than in-process:\n\n| rows | test |\n|---|---|\n| 179, 214 | `uncaught_throw_aborts_identically`, `null_panic_handler_aborts_identically` (`tests/b05_stackapi.rs`) |\n| 178 | `savetry_endtry_underflow_matches` (`tests/b05_stackapi.rs`) |\n| (re-`jsB_init*` on a strict state) | `jsB_initerror_strict_aborts_identically` (`tests/b05_stackapi.rs`), `jsB_init_strict_aborts_identically` (`tests/c12_internals.rs`) |\n\n### Additional C-side UB found while testing (not translation defects)\n\n| what | detail |\n|---